  "body": "**Describe the bug**\n\nThis is a follow up for PR https://github.com/jgromes/RadioLib/pull/1751#issuecomment-4275767778\n\nSince the LR2021 module is heavily derived from LR11x0 one,\nthe issue with enforced `RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH` value for `setPacketParamsGFSK` still remains in the  LR11x0 module source code as well:\n\n```\n$ cd LR11x0\n$ grep setPacketParamsGFSK *.cpp\nLR11x0_commands.cpp:int16_t LR11x0::setPacketParamsGFSK(uint16_t preambleLen, uint8_t preambleDetectorLen, uint8_t syncWordLen, uint8_t addrCmp, uint8_t packType, uint8_t payloadLen, uint8_t crcType, uint8_t whiten) {\nLR11x0.cpp:    state = setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening);\nLR11x0.cpp:  state = setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening);\nLR11x0.cpp:  state = setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening);\nLR11x0.cpp:  return(setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening));\nLR11x0.cpp:  return(setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening));\nLR11x0.cpp:    return(setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening));\nLR11x0.cpp:    state = setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, RADIOLIB_LR11X0_MAX_PACKET_LENGTH, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening);\nLR11x0.cpp:        state = setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, this->packetType, cfg->transmit.len, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening);\nLR11x0.cpp:  state = setPacketParamsGFSK(this->preambleLengthGFSK, this->preambleDetLength, this->syncWordLength, this->addrComp, mode, len, this->crcTypeGFSK, this->whitening);\n\n```\n",
